Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather round, come take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Theatre of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.17,0:00:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,DECIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the story of a certain junior high school girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom can do everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She helps me with my homework,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and her cooking and sewing are perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Minori,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I baked an apple pie for your snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,actually Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go to Yami High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That high school that's so hard to get into?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think about it for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I consult her about,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,my mom's face never darkens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.14,0:00:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,She always helps me make the right decisions for my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,About yesterday's talk about high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:01:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,do as you like, Minori.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be safer aiming for a school you're guaranteed to pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.70,0:01:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My father wasn't around for as long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I never felt lonely,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,he must have been a terrible guy for abandoning my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.17,0:01:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised myself I'd never let her be sad again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.13,0:01:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.93,0:01:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Minori!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my proud daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.57,0:01:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother raised me all by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.69,0:01:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I wanted her to take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,For just a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it felt like my mother's smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Mom on the phone with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.17,0:01:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...But then, I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,will I no longer be asking for your advice about that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined a day like this would come...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.37,0:02:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom had been consulting him all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,while my mom was out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I secretly snuck into her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.30,0:02:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it's locked!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't forgive this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To think he was manipulating my beloved mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give my mom back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Give my mom back! GIVE MY MOM BACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Minori, I'm sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make dinner right away—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Minori...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The dresser was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:02:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After that my mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.63,0:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't manage the housework anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and our home fell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,became unable to speak, except one thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Decide...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat the bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Decide...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to the bathroom when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll decide everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,THE END
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.37,0:03:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,SCENE NOTE:\NWhen the girl destroys what was inside the room (thinking her father was manipulating her mother through the phone/altar/relic),
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,her mother was actually relying on that entity/object to make every single decision in her life. Upon its destruction, the mother falls into a vegetative/catatonic state, repeating only the word "decide" (kimete).
